# Prefer vanilla

## Default stance

Content pages ship **HTML and CSS only**. The template has no Vue, React, or Svelte runtime.

## When interactivity is needed

1. Native HTML first (`<details>`, `<dialog>`, form `action` to API routes)
2. CSS-only states (`:hover`, `:focus-visible`, `@custom-variant`)
3. Vanilla TS in an Astro island (`client:load` / `client:visible`) only if 1–2 cannot work

## Forbidden without explicit request

- Adding React, Vue, Svelte, or Preact dependencies
- Hydrating entire layouts or section lists
- Client-side routers or global state libraries

## Exceptions already accepted

- `@types/react` — devDependency for `@vercel/og` types only (ADR-0003)
- `@vercel/og` — server endpoint, not client bundle

Measure bundle impact before adding any `client:*` directive.
